  "notes": "{高|たか}まる means to rise, increase, or intensify. An intransitive godan verb.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {高|たか}まる (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧): to rise (by itself)\n- ⟦{高|たか}める→高める：02065_takameru⟧ (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧): to raise (something)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{期待|きたい}→期待：00238_kitai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{高|たか}まる: expectations rise\n- ⟦{緊張|きんちょう}→緊張：02494_kinchou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{高|たか}まる: tension increases\n- ⟦{関心|かんしん}→関心：00182_kanshin⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{高|たか}まる: interest grows\n- ⟦{気持|きも}ち→気持ち：01385_kimochi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{高|たか}まる: feelings intensify\n- ⟦{需要|じゅよう}→需要：02616_juyou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{高|たか}まる: demand increases\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{高|たか}まって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a continuing state of heightened level or ongoing increase.",
